    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Forbes Property are delighted to present this exceptional family home to the market in the highly sought-after Cuil Dúin development, Citywest.**\n\nBeautifully presented throughout, this impressive residence offers bright, spacious and contemporary accommodation designed for modern family living. Finished to a high standard, the property combines stylish interiors with generous proportions, creating a home that is both practical and inviting.\n\nThe heart of the home is a superb open-plan kitchen and dining area, ideal for everyday family life and entertaining, while the spacious living room provides the perfect place to relax. Upstairs, well-proportioned bedrooms offer comfortable accommodation, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an en-suite bathroom. A private rear garden provides an ideal outdoor space for dining, entertaining or simply enjoying the sunshine.\n\nCuil Dúin has become one of Citywest's most desirable residential developments, renowned for its modern homes, landscaped surroundings and excellent connectivity. Residents enjoy immediate access to a wealth of amenities including local schools, shops, cafés, sports clubs and childcare facilities. The Citywest Shopping Centre, LUAS Red Line, N7, M50 and Citywest Business Campus are all within easy reach, making this an ideal location for commuters and growing families alike. The development also benefits from the addition of a new community and crèche facility, further enhancing the area's family-friendly appeal.\n\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in one of South Dublin's fastest-growing and best-connected neighbourhoods. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
